// newtnrLabelTimeInputLine: a time input line whose time can only be picked with the
// time popup (the NPR's newtNRLabelTimeInputLine).
//
// This file holds newtnrLabelTimeInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
// access 'pickOnly: the value can only be set with the filter's picker, not written
newtnrLabelTimeInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtTimeFilter, access: 'pickOnly};
